61
00:03:07.075 --> 00:03:09.235
Entonces hay mesodermo extraembrionario,

62
00:03:09.275 --> 00:03:11.575
mesodermo intraembrionario, pero es sobre todo el

63
00:03:11.615 --> 00:03:12.796
